# Valgrind suppressions for MICROBOTICA
# Populate with Qt/Python/OpenUSD suppressions when Valgrind CI is enabled in Phase 1.
#
# Usage:
#   valgrind --suppressions=valgrind.suppressions ./build/debug/tests/microbotica_tests
#
# Known categories to suppress:
# - Qt internal allocations (QObject, QMetaObject)
# - Python interpreter shutdown leaks
# - OpenUSD plugin registry singleton leaks
